        "docs": "Returns a raw sms object (all columns). Its like running SELECT * FROM ..\n\nE.g.\n```json\n{\n  \"_id\": 33,\n  \"thread_id\": 153,\n  \"address\": \"TEST\",\n  \"person\": null,\n  \"date\": 1679232404564,\n  \"date_sent\": 1679562604444,\n  \"protocol\": 0,\n  \"read\": 0,\n  \"status\": -1,\n  \"type\": 1,\n  \"reply_path_present\": 0,\n  \"subject\": null,\n  \"body\": \"SMS body\",\n  \"service_center\": \"+918299901123\",\n  \"locked\": 0,\n  \"sub_id\": 1,\n  \"error_code\": 0,\n  \"creator\": \"com.google.android.apps.messaging\",\n  \"seen\": 1,\n  \"priority\": -1\n}\n```\n**Note: This is a raw query and ineffecient. Use with caution**",
